#==============================================================================================
#
#   main_thread_vm - Bindings::MainThreadVM: the process's VM, its agent, new JavaScript realms
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Bindings/MainThreadVM.cpp (lines 1-809) and MainThreadVM.h
#       (lines 1-44). initialize_main_thread_vm creates the VM and its surrounding agent;
#       create_a_new_javascript_realm is how every Window (and the internal CSS realm) gets its
#       realm; the mutation-observer microtask and the custom element reactions are the agent's.
#       Of the host hooks initialize_main_thread_vm installs into LibJS, the promise ones
#       (rejection tracking, job callbacks, promise jobs) are in main_thread_vm_host_hooks; the
#       others (finalization registry cleanup, import.meta, module loading, private elements,
#       string compilation, eval code, array buffer resizing) are callbacks of the JS engine:
#       they are listed at their place and come with luce-js in phase 3.
#
